{ MIDDLEGAME PLAN BOX (read this first; engine-derived draft, edit before publishing)
GAME: a model game (1-0) for Plan #7, viewed from White's side of the board. Opening chapters: #16, #20 (their Opening Boxes give the benchmark and the minimum acceptable).
